                <!-- Column 1 -->
                <div class="seo-column">
                    <h3 class="seo-subheading"><u>Why Choose Direct-Sourced Dry Fruits &amp; Certified Staples?</u></h3>
                    <p class="seo-intro-p">
                        Commercial bulk dry fruits are frequently treated with sulphur dioxide fumigation to artificially prolong shelf life and mask aging oils. Cherubic Amulya bypasses multi-tier intermediaries to bring you whole, living kernels straight from source.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="seo-bullet-list">
                        <li><span class="arrow-bullet">&#10148;</span> <strong>Zero Sulphur Fumigation:</strong> Preserves natural sweetness and prevents asthmatic reactions caused by industrial preservatives.</li>
                        <li><span class="arrow-bullet">&#10148;</span> <strong>Maximum Kernel Integrity:</strong> Hand-graded W240 cashews and Mamra almonds guarantee full kernels with zero broken fragments.</li>
                        <li><span class="arrow-bullet">&#10148;</span> <strong>Sealed in Food Grade Jars:</strong> Prevents rancidity of delicate natural unsaturated fatty acids and preserves distinct crunch.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- Column 2 -->
                <div class="seo-column">
                    <h3 class="seo-subheading"><u>The Science Behind 100% Unpolished Pulses &amp; Whole Grains</u></h3>
                    <p class="seo-intro-p">
                        To give lentils their uniform supermarket shine, industrial millers use water, marble dust, and edible oil polishers. This cosmetic process destroys the vital aleurone layer containing over 60% of the grain's natural nutrients.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="seo-bullet-list">
                        <li><span class="arrow-bullet">&#10148;</span> <strong>Natural Prebiotic Fiber Intact:</strong> Unpolished lentils nourish beneficial gut microbiota, preventing post-prandial bloating.</li>
                        <li><span class="arrow-bullet">&#10148;</span> <strong>Low Glycemic Index:</strong> Slow-digesting carbohydrates prevent rapid insulin spikes, making them ideal for diabetic management.</li>
                        <li><span class="arrow-bullet">&#10148;</span> <strong>Bioavailable Micronutrients:</strong> Retains essential dietary iron, zinc, folic acid, and plant protein in every serving.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- Column 3 -->
                <div class="seo-column">
                    <h3 class="seo-subheading"><u>Ancient Himalayan Mineral Salts vs. Refined Table Salt</u></h3>
                    <p class="seo-intro-p">
                        Standard commercial table salt is heavily bleached and stripped of all minerals except sodium chloride, then laced with synthetic anti-caking compounds (E535 and E536) to prevent clumping in plastic dispensers.
