                <div class="faq-accordion-card">
                    <button type="button" class="faq-question-btn" aria-expanded="false">
                        <span>How does Cherubic Amulya ensure dry fruit freshness and zero adulteration?</span>
                        <span class="faq-indicator">+</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer-panel" hidden>
                        <p>Every single batch undergoes a strict 5-stage mechanical quality audit in Kanpur: sorting for uniform size, moisture-testing below 5%, optical sorting for kernel flaws, and UV sanitation. Finally, products are sealed into food-grade cylindrical jars with chocolate brown screw caps to ensure unopened crispness for 9 months.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ Item 2 -->
                <div class="faq-accordion-card">
                    <button type="button" class="faq-question-btn" aria-expanded="false">
                        <span>What is the delivery timeframe for Kanpur and all-India destinations?</span>
                        <span class="faq-indicator">+</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer-panel" hidden>
                        <p>For Kanpur city addresses, orders received before 2:00 PM qualify for same-day evening delivery from our Dada Nagar facility. All other locations across India are dispatched within 24 hours through express courier services (Blue Dart, Delhivery) with typical transit times of 2 to 4 business days.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ Item 3 -->
                <div class="faq-accordion-card">
                    <button type="button" class="faq-question-btn" aria-expanded="false">
                        <span>Are your pulses and dry fruits certified by FSSAI?</span>
                        <span class="faq-indicator">+</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer-panel" hidden>
                        <p>Yes. Cherubic Amulya operates strictly under Central FSSAI License No. 12721055000341. Our packaging and storage facilities in 173-B, Dada Nagar, Kanpur adhere to ISO 22000 and Good Manufacturing Practice (GMP) food safety standards.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right Column FAQs -->
            <div class="faq-column">
                <!-- FAQ Item 4 -->
                <div class="faq-accordion-card">
                    <button type="button" class="faq-question-btn" aria-expanded="false">
                        <span>Can I place bulk or corporate gifting orders for festive events?</span>
                        <span class="faq-indicator">+</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer-panel" hidden>
                        <p>Absolutely. We curate custom festive dry fruit jar hampers, institutional wooden crates, and bulk raw supplies for weddings, corporate celebrations, and confectioneries. Click the &ldquo;Bulk Enquiry&rdquo; button in our header to receive custom quotes within 2 hours.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ Item 5 -->
                <div class="faq-accordion-card">
                    <button type="button" class="faq-question-btn" aria-expanded="false">
                        <span>Why do unpolished dals look less shiny than supermarket lentils?</span>
                        <span class="faq-indicator">+</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer-panel" hidden>
                        <p>Supermarket pulses are subjected to oil, talc stone, and water polishes to achieve an artificial gloss. This strips the vital aleurone skin. Cherubic Amulya lentils retain their natural, matte, rustic appearance, ensuring full protein, fiber, and earthy flavour.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ Item 6 -->
                <div class="faq-accordion-card">
                    <button type="button" class="faq-question-btn" aria-expanded="false">
                        <span>Do your traditional preserves contain artificial colours or chemicals?</span>
                        <span class="faq-indicator">+</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer-panel" hidden>
                        <p>Never. Our Amla Murabba and digestive treats are cooked purely with whole winter amla berries and pure mishri (unrefined rock sugar). Natural preservation occurs via rock sugar saturation and natural citrus acidity without synthetic chemicals.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- =========================================================================
     14 & 15. THE COMPLETE AMULYA EDIT CATALOG: INTERACTIVE FILTER & SEARCH
     ========================================================================= -->
<section class="roopak-catalog-section" id="shop">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="section-title-wrap">
            <span class="roopak-eyebrow">THE AMULYA EDIT</span>
            <h2 class="roopak-section-title">Complete <em>Harvest Storefront</em></h2>
            <p class="section-subtext">Filter across categories, search for specific nutrition staples, or click any jar for detailed provenance.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Catalog Toolbar -->
        <div class="catalog-toolbar">
            <div class="filter-pill-tabs" id="filterTabs">
                <button type="button" class="filter-pill active" data-filter="All">All Items (21)</button>
                <button type="button" class="filter-pill" data-filter="Dry Fruits">Dry Fruits</button>
                <button type="button" class="filter-pill" data-filter="Seeds">Seeds</button>
                <button type="button" class="filter-pill" data-filter="Salts & Seasonings">Salts &amp; Seasonings</button>
                <button type="button" class="filter-pill" data-filter="Preserves & Sweets">Preserves &amp; Sweets</button>
                <button type="button" class="filter-pill" data-filter="Grains & Pulses">Grains &amp; Pulses</button>
            </div>

            <div class="catalog-search-box">
                <span class="catalog-search-icon">&#9906;</span>
                <input type="search" id="productSearch" placeholder="Search our 21 pantry treasures..." aria-label="Search catalog products">
            </div>
        </div>

                <!-- Dynamic Catalog Grid Rendered by site.js with Jar Styling -->
        <div class="product-grid" id="products">
            @foreach (var prod in allProducts)
            {
                <div class="roopak-product-card" data-product-id="@prod.Id" data-category="@prod.Category">
                    @if (prod.Tag?.ToUpper().Contains("POPULAR") == true || prod.Tag?.ToUpper().Contains("BESTSELLER") == true || prod.Tag?.ToUpper().Contains("ROYAL") == true) { <div class="card-ribbon-popular">Most Popular</div> }
                    <div class="product-thumb-box" onclick="window.kalashOpenModal && window.kalashOpenModal(@prod.Id)">
                        <div class="amulya-jar-showcase">
                            <div class="amulya-jar-cap"></div>
                            <div class="amulya-jar-neck"></div>
                            <div class="amulya-jar-body">
                                <img class="amulya-jar-fill" src="@prod.ImageUrl" alt="@prod.Name" loading="lazy" onerror="this.src='/images/cashew.png'" />
                                <div class="amulya-jar-glare"></div>
                                <div class="amulya-jar-sticker">
                                    <span class="st-brand">AMULYA</span>
                                    <span class="st-name">@prod.Name.ToUpperInvariant()</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="amulya-jar-shadow"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="product-details-box">
                        <h3 class="product-name" onclick="window.kalashOpenModal && window.kalashOpenModal(@prod.Id)">@prod.Name</h3>
                        <div class="product-price-tag">&#8377;@prod.Price.ToString("0.00")</div>
                        @if (prod.Stock > 0)
                        {
                            <button type="button" class="btn-outline-add" onclick="window.kalashAddToCart(@prod.Id)">
                                ADD TO CART
                            </button>
                        }
                        else
                        {
                            <button type="button" class="btn-outline-add btn-out-of-stock" disabled>
                                OUT OF STOCK
                            </button>
                        }
                    </div>
                </div>
            }
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<script>
    window.AMULYA_CATALOG = @Html.Raw(System.Text.Json.JsonSerializer.Serialize(allProducts.Select(p => new {
        id = p.Id,
        name = p.Name,
        category = p.Category,
        price = p.Price,
        mrp = p.Mrp > 0 ? p.Mrp : Math.Round(p.Price * 1.25m),
        weight = p.Weight,
        stock = p.Stock,
        description = p.Description,
        image = p.ImageUrl,
        tag = p.Tag
    })));
</script>

